            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio omwami Solomoni arakikha khukhwombakha enju ya Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi mu Yerusalemu khu sikulu sia Moria. Ano niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aaba ne aabonekhela Daudi, raraawe owa Solomoni. Solomoni ombakha Lukaangu abuundu niio Daudi aba ne arekekha khu luuya lwe khuulilakho lwa Orinani Omuyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aarakikha khukhwombakha Lukaangu khu mwesi kwa khabili kwe kumwiiko kukhola khane kwe khukhwamiia khwewe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebino nibio bibiaba bipiimilo bia Solomoni bie khukhwombakha enju eya Wele. Buleeyi mu bipiimilo bikhale bwaba bikele kamakhumi sita ne bukhiikha bwaba bikele kamakhumi kabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lusiro lwe khukhwingila mukari lwaba bikele buleeyi kamakhumi kabili, lulwaleekhaana ne bukhiikha bwe enju. Ne buleeyi bwalwo bwaba bikele emia ndala ne kamakhumi kabili. Aalufuunikha ne esahabu endayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aara chimbao cha Saipurasi khwisiisi lie mukari lie lusiro lubalaayi lwe Lukaangu mala achifuunikha ne esahabu enukhu. Aachora khwisiisi okhwo bifwaani bie kimirongooro kimikheendu ne kiminyololo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aarona Lukaangu ne kamabaale ke bukusi bwe angaaki. Ne esahabu niyo arumikhira yama Paribaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aakha esahabu khu Lukaangu, ne khu mitalaachi, kamatooche, khwisiisi ne khu miliango mala aachonga chikerubi khu masiisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
